っけ？一回、二回…","nextNodeIds":[250310409]},{"nodeId":250310409,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20776,"speakerName":"ナザム","textMapHash":3220092394,"text":"アレはカウントしないでくれ。あの時、行きたくないとかほざいたのはあんただからな。","nextNodeIds":[250310410]},{"nodeId":250310410,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":4267669642,"text":"あの時のことはカウントしてないよ。それに、私はちゃんとお金を払ったんだからね。どうしてそんなこと言われなきゃいけないの。","nextNodeIds":[250310411]},{"nodeId":250310411,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20776,"speakerName":"ナザム","textMapHash":1573491666,"text":"それっぽっちのお金じゃ、適当に食って飲んでればなくなるさ。","nextNodeIds":[250310412]},{"nodeId":250310412,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":689267994,"text":"論文のために来たの？","nextNodeIds":[250310413]},{"nodeId":250310413,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":1145495770,"text":"へへっ…もう随分時間をかけてきたから、無駄にするわけにはいかないんだ…","nextNodeIds":[250310414]},{"nodeId":250310414,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":3800811538,"text":"今回はちゃんと教令院に専用の経費を申請して、誰とも課題が被ってないことを確認したんだから。","nextNodeIds":[250310415]},{"nodeId":250310415,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":3072264554,"text":"それに、ナザムが護衛だから、悪いやつは全部彼女が片づけてくれてるの。","nextNodeIds":[250310416]},{"nodeId":250310416,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20776,"speakerName":"ナザム","textMapHash":3080429754,"text":"それはな、アタシら襲ってもうま味がないから、わざわざちょっかいかけてくる輩がいないだけだ。","nextNodeIds":[250310417,250310418]},{"nodeId":250310417,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":236029098,"text":"それじゃあ、さっきのは…","nextNodeIds":[250310419]},{"nodeId":250310419,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20776,"speakerName":"ナザム","textMapHash":1101262058,"text":"…こいつ、文献を入れたバッグを死ぬほど固く抱えて、「こだまの子」の方からここまで歩いてきたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[250310420]},{"nodeId":250310420,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20776,"speakerName":"ナザム","textMapHash":3522131730,"text":"正直、アタシから見ても、懐にお宝を抱えてるバカにしか見えない。","nextNodeIds":[250310421]},{"nodeId":250310421,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20776,"speakerName":"ナザム","textMapHash":2350850746,"text":"お宝を抱えたやつが、こんな人気のない荒野を護衛一人だけ付けて歩いてるとなると…誰だって賭けてみようと思うさ。","nextNodeIds":[250310422]},{"nodeId":250310422,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":1460207322,"text":"そうよ！私のバッグに入ってるのはお宝だよ。実地見聞した記録と、各種文献の写しが入ってるんだから。","nextNodeIds":[250310423]},{"nodeId":250310423,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":1166261970,"text":"これがあれば、私はあの論文を完成させられる！","nextNodeIds":[250310424]},{"nodeId":250310424,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":3149568498,"text":"ふふん、論文のタイトルは「帰火聖夜の巡礼」なんだからね。圧倒的な学術価値があるから、卒業させてくれるに決まってる。","nextNodeIds":[250310425]},{"nodeId":250310425,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":2591052322,"text":"ああでも、タフムーラスがアドバイスしてくれたおかげでもある。さすが私の親友、えへへ。","nextNodeIds":[250310426]},{"nodeId":250310426,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":3449939074,"text":"#本当にありがとう、{NICKNAME}、あなたがいなかったら、あの悪者たちに本を破られて、モラまで奪われるところだった！","nextNodeIds":[250310427]},{"nodeId":250310427,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":842587298,"text":"この前、書籍と資料の整理のお手伝いで、やっと少し稼いだのに、これを奪われたら、新しい資料を買えなくなっちゃう。","nextNodeIds":[250310428]},{"nodeId":250310428,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20776,"speakerName":"ナザム","textMapHash":87622306,"text":"ああ、あんたは全ての金を本に使うからな。アタシがあんたの財布を持ってなきゃ、二人とも餓死してるよ。","nextNodeIds":[250310429]},{"nodeId":250310429,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":536546474,"text":"そ、そんなに買ったわけじゃ…","nextNodeIds":[250310430]},{"nodeId":250310430,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":4177772794,"text":"もう、雑談はここまでにしよう。私たちはこれから「流泉の衆」に取材しに行かないといけないの。","nextNodeIds":[250310431]},{"nodeId":250310431,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20088,"speakerName":"アラニ","textMapHash":2638294290,"text":"それじゃあね。次に会う時は、きっと私の論文も完成してるはず！その時は、絶対ご馳走してあげるね！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":250310418,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3021016618,"text":"結局面倒事に巻き込まれた。","nextNodeIds":[250310419]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2503104,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133504240"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"},{"LNHLPKELCAL":["133504634"],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_EXEC_UNREGISTER_DYNAMIC_GROUP"}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["20088"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2503105,"order":5,"stepDescription":"タフムーラスに報告する","stepDescTextMapHash":3535484340,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2503105,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["6087"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"},"isHidden":false,"talkIds":[2503105],"talks":[{"talkId":2503105,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":